---

---

<section
  class="relative py-20 lg:py-32 px-6 lg:px-12 bg-[var(--cor-fundo-suave)] overflow-hidden border-t border-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/20"
>
  <div
    class="absolute top-1/2 left-10 w-96 h-96 bg-[var(--cor-destaque)]/5 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none -z-0"
  >
  </div>
  <div
    class="absolute top-10 right-10 w-80 h-80 bg-[var(--cor-secundaria)]/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none -z-0"
  >
  </div>

  <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto z-10">
    <div
      class="flex flex-col items-center text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16 lg:mb-24"
    >
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
        <span class="w-8 h-px bg-[var(--cor-secundaria)]"></span>
        <span
          class="text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.25em] uppercase text-[var(--cor-texto)]"
        >
          Experiências Reais
        </span>
        <span class="w-8 h-px bg-[var(--cor-secundaria)]"></span>
      </div>

      <h2
        class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-[2.75rem] text-[var(--cor-texto)] leading-[1.15] mb-5 tracking-tight"
      >
        O que dizem as nossas <span
          class="italic font-normal text-[var(--cor-destaque)]">clientes</span
        >
      </h2>

      <p
        class="text-base sm:text-lg text-[var(--cor-texto-suave)] font-light leading-relaxed max-w-xl"
      >
        Histórias genuínas de quem confia na Klassy para os seus momentos únicos
        de cuidado, beleza e bem-estar.
      </p>
    </div>

